    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-what-is-llamahub",
        "moduleId": "llamahub-position",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "LlamaHub 的定位",
        "markdown": "LlamaHub 是 LlamaIndex 生态中的注册中心，汇集了数百个集成组件、智能体和工具，这些资源都可以直接在 LlamaIndex 框架中使用。课程后续会反复使用其中的集成组件，因此先理解它的定位，再学习如何查找并安装所需组件。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-7292b904174cec3c19c934e3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000130"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2.2 单元. LlamaIndex 框架",
                "LlamaHub 简介"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3651,
              "lineEnd": 3663,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://huggingface.co/datasets/agents-course/course-images/resolve/main/en/unit2/llama-index/llama-hub.png"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "5494657de646eaa734c81b6dde9e94858cc1e6bb38415369ec01efbf0969991e"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-registry-not-framework",
        "moduleId": "llamahub-position",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：注册中心不等于框架",
        "markdown": "需要区分两个层次：LlamaIndex 是构建智能体应用的框架，而 LlamaHub 是向这个框架供应集成资源的注册中心。它本身不负责推理或编排，价值在于把可用的组件集中登记，让开发者不必从零编写每一条与外部工具连接的代码。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-what-is-llamahub"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-install-command",
        "moduleId": "install-component",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "安装命令的统一格式",
        "markdown": "LlamaIndex 的安装说明可以在 LlamaHub 官网查到。初次接触会感觉有些复杂，但大多数安装命令都遵循便于记忆的统一格式：\n\n```bash\npip install llama-index-{component-type}-{framework-name}\n```\n\n以 Hugging Face 推理 API 集成的 LLM 组件为例，实际命令是 `pip install llama-index-llms-huggingface-api`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-7292b904174cec3c19c934e3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000131"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2.2 单元. LlamaIndex 框架",
                "LlamaHub 简介",
                "安装"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3664,
              "lineEnd": 3678,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b3204de306d272493b9f19c50e9008ad796e62513667a8487db86e0d9fb67e16"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-transfer-apply",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "迁移练习：换一个组件",
        "markdown": "如果要改用另一个集成组件，可以按同一顺序操作：先在 LlamaHub 官网确认组件类别与框架名，得到安装命令；安装后再根据包名推出导入路径；最后按该组件的文档实例化并调用。因为所有集成资源都来自同一个注册中心，这套流程可以整体复用，而不必为每个组件重新摸索。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-what-is-llamahub",
            "textbook-install-command"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-install-command-anatomy",
        "moduleId": "install-component",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：拆解命令模板",
        "markdown": "教材给出的模板可以拆成三段理解：前缀 `llama-index` 标明所属生态，`{component-type}` 说明组件类别（示例中是 `llms`），`{framework-name}` 指明具体对接的框架或服务（示例中是 `huggingface-api`）。因此只要先确定组件类型和目标框架，就能拼出对应的安装包名。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-command"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-usage-import",
        "moduleId": "import-and-use",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "安装后的使用方式",
        "markdown": "安装完成后就能看到使用模式：导入路径跟在安装命令后面。下面是以 Hugging Face 推理 API 作为 LLM 组件时的使用示例：\n\n```python\nfrom llama_index.llms.huggingface_api import HuggingFaceInferenceAPI\n\nllm = HuggingFaceInferenceAPI(\n    model_name=\"Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct\",\n    temperature=0.7,\n    max_tokens=100,\n    token=\"hf_xxx\",\n)\n\nllm.complete(\"Hello, how are you?\")\n```\n\n示例中 `llm.complete(...)` 直接返回模型的回答，说明安装好的组件已经可以像普通 Python 对象一样调用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-7292b904174cec3c19c934e3",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000132"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 2.2 单元. LlamaIndex 框架",
                "LlamaHub 简介",
                "用法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 3679,
