              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "bf3af95c400a530d4f1be2b12ddbb68a5bed772a0908045066019ae6df72de32"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-package-import-mapping",
        "moduleId": "import-and-use",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：包名到导入路径的对应规则",
        "markdown": "把安装包名与导入路径对照，可以总结出一条稳定的对应规则：包名中的连字符在导入路径里变成层级分隔的点，`llama-index-llms-huggingface-api` 对应 `llama_index.llms.huggingface_api`，其中最后一段以下划线连接。先记住安装命令，再按这条规则还原导入语句，就能减少反复查文档的次数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-command",
            "textbook-usage-import"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-install-use-checklist",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "安装与使用的检查表",
        "markdown": "| 环节 | 依据 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 确定组件类型 | 命令模板中的 `{component-type}` | `llms` |\n| 安装依赖 | 套用 `pip install llama-index-{component-type}-{framework-name}` | `pip install llama-index-llms-huggingface-api` |\n| 推导导入路径 | 包名连字符转为点，末段用下划线 | `from llama_index.llms.huggingface_api import HuggingFaceInferenceAPI` |\n| 使用组件 | 按组件文档实例化并调用 | `llm.complete(\"Hello, how are you?\")` |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-install-command",
            "textbook-usage-import"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-summary",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "小结",
        "markdown": "回顾本节：LlamaHub 是 LlamaIndex 的集成资源注册中心；安装依赖时套用 `pip install llama-index-{component-type}-{framework-name}` 这类统一命令；使用组件时按安装包名还原导入路径，再实例化并调用。三步串起来，就完成了从查找、安装到使用的闭环。",
        "provenance": {
